@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity
@using LocoRealt.Models
@inject SignInManager<ApplicationUser> SignInManager
@inject UserManager<ApplicationUser> UserManager

<ul class="navbar-nav">
    @if (SignInManager.IsSignedIn(User))
    {
        <li class="nav-item dropdown">
            <a class="nav-link dropdown-toggle" href="#" role="button" data-bs-toggle="dropdown">
                <i class="fas fa-user-circle me-1"></i> @User.Identity?.Name
            </a>
            <ul class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end">
                <li>
                    @if (User.IsInRole("Admin"))
                    {
                        <a class="dropdown-item" asp-area="Admin" asp-controller="Dashboard" asp-action="Index">
                            <i class="fas fa-cog me-1"></i> Админ-панель
                        </a>
                    }
                    else if (User.IsInRole("Agent"))
                    {
                        <a class="dropdown-item" asp-area="Agent" asp-controller="Dashboard" asp-action="Index">
                            <i class="fas fa-user-tie me-1"></i> Кабинет агента
                        </a>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <a class="dropdown-item" asp-area="User" asp-controller="Dashboard" asp-action="Index">
                            <i class="fas fa-user me-1"></i> Личный кабинет
                        </a>
                    }
                </li>
                <li><hr class="dropdown-divider" /></li>
                <li>
                    <form asp-area="Identity"
                          asp-page="/Account/Logout"
                          asp-route-returnUrl="@Url.Action("Index", "Home")"
                          method="post"
                          class="px-3">
                        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
                        <button type="submit" class="dropdown-item text-danger">
                            <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt me-1"></i> Выйти
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </li>
    }
    else
    {
        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link" asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Register">
                <i class="fas fa-user-plus me-1"></i> Регистрация
            </a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link" asp-area="Identity" asp-page="/Account/Login">
                <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt me-1"></i> Вход
            </a>
        </li>
    }
</ul>